      "name": "Table 9",
      "hidden": false,
      "parentId": null,
      "inheritedFrom": null,
      "kind": "table",
      "text": "\nDESCRIPTION\nAPPROXIMATE TIME\n\nOutline the ‘north star’ for channel strategy and establish key guiding principles\nDefined north star and guiding principles will inform the future state client contact strategy \nGaps in the current state offering will highlight improvement opportunities\n60 mins (followed by break)\n\nDevelop future state ‘client contact strategy’ by identifying and refining key foundational themes\nWhat are key client contact strategy elements?\nHow do we categorize client needs?\nWhat are the optimal service models to address distinct client needs?\nHow do we deliver these service models across channels?\nWhat team structure can support this evolved approach?\nWhat is an effective client routing and channel connectivity strategy?\n120 minutes (followed by break)\n\nEvaluate and assess strategic changes to achieve defined north star\nDesign elements and future state for team structure\nClient selection and assignment\nLead orchestration for outbound channels\nVirtual value proposition\nIf time permits\n\nIdentify enhanced or new capabilities required to deliver channel vision\nCapabilities to augment and improve virtual servicing\nBroader capability requirements to enable virtual growth\nIf time permits\n",
